Subject: [PATCH 060/244] Refine message extraction when agents mention workers

Update regex to correctly capture message body in agent mentions by excluding extraneous text following the target worker name.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: 96d1d77e-161e-4fa9-8457-e231e7a87166
Replit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint
